00:18:46.550 --> 00:18:49.653
you can't find excuses
for what you've done.

00:18:50.590 --> 00:18:52.610
You have to take responsibility.

00:18:52.610 --> 00:18:54.110
But I think a combination

00:18:54.110 --> 00:18:58.590
of all these things together
did lead to what happened

00:18:58.590 --> 00:19:03.020
in my life and changed my
life now forever in some ways

00:19:04.760 --> 00:19:09.760
spiritual ways and emotional
ways, maybe a positive

00:19:11.590 --> 00:19:13.870
because I've become more
understanding about things

00:19:13.870 --> 00:19:18.870
in the world and people in
other ways, some nightmare

00:19:22.196 --> 00:19:24.323
- [Mark] How's your, how has
your family reacted to it?

