- My father old school
European was very embracing.

00:19:32.860 --> 00:19:37.640
Those that knew me and
do know me were surprised

00:19:41.060 --> 00:19:46.060
and shocked, but they also
we're understanding with

00:19:51.030 --> 00:19:53.580
they knew who I was before all this

00:19:53.580 --> 00:19:55.730
that they knew the
caring and loving person

00:19:56.900 --> 00:20:01.900
and the mistakes that
I've been lucky that most

00:20:03.370 --> 00:20:06.363
