have overlooked the mistake.

00:20:11.640 --> 00:20:13.410
And even though they've accepted and,

00:20:13.410 --> 00:20:17.730
and the love is still
there, it doesn't take away.

00:20:17.730 --> 00:20:18.873
It's still in my head.

00:20:20.560 --> 00:20:22.270
- [Mark] How often does it come up in your

00:20:22.270 --> 00:20:24.210
how often is it in your thoughts?

00:20:24.210 --> 00:20:25.043
- I'm sorry.

00:20:25.043 --> 00:20:27.080
