00:20:27.080 --> 00:20:32.080
- It's actually, I, the, it's,
the, what brought me here.

00:20:35.620 --> 00:20:40.610
The, actually being an
offender, affects me every day.

00:20:40.610 --> 00:20:42.183
I think about it daily.

00:20:43.810 --> 00:20:47.323
I pray on it and I try
to continue learning

00:20:52.290 --> 00:20:57.010
not just for myself, but
listen to others and reading

00:20:57.010 --> 00:20:58.400
doing as much research

00:20:58.400 --> 00:21:02.873
as I can to understand
what makes this happen.

00:21:05.020 --> 00:21:08.007
Not everyone has all the answers for me.

00:21:10.210 --> 00:21:11.120
It's something I do.

00:21:11.120 --> 00:21:12.270
I deal with every day.

00:21:12.270 --> 00:21:13.963
I, it breaks my heart.

00:21:16.670 --> 00:21:19.300
- [Mark] What's the most
important lesson you've learned

00:21:21.940 --> 00:21:25.123
- The most important
lesson in all of this.

00:21:26.950 --> 00:21:28.790
When you feel your life spiraling

00:21:28.790 --> 00:21:31.603
out of control, ask for help.

00:21:32.640 --> 00:21:36.110
If for, you take it to another level

00:21:36.110 --> 00:21:41.110
whether it's molestation or suicide

00:21:43.010 --> 00:21:46.250
or driving under the influence.

00:21:46.250 --> 00:21:50.540
If you feel yourself, spiraling
out of control in any way

00:21:50.540 --> 00:21:55.540
shape or form, and life is
more than you can handle to me.

00:21:58.060 --> 00:22:03.060
It's okay to ask for help where
too many people are expected

00:22:03.620 --> 00:22:08.620
in the world to not have
problems to not need help.

00:22:13.650 --> 00:22:15.460
And I really believe that's one

00:22:15.460 --> 00:22:19.170
of the biggest mistakes now that you

00:22:19.170 --> 00:22:22.780
when you asked my biggest
mistake is I didn't ask

00:22:22.780 --> 00:22:24.743
for help before it got that far.

00:22:30.010 --> 00:22:35.010
There's nothing wrong in admitting defeat.

00:22:37.040 --> 00:22:42.040
And sometimes world, the
world seems to defeat us.

00:22:42.390 --> 00:22:45.530
And the reality is when you speak

00:22:45.530 --> 00:22:47.520
with somebody and you
put the words out there

00:22:47.520 --> 00:22:50.060
you realize you're still more powerful

00:22:50.060 --> 00:22:52.020
and you can conquer over everything

00:22:59.030 --> 00:22:59.943
Ask for help.

00:23:01.680 --> 00:23:03.243
