surgery two months ago

00:23:38.710 --> 00:23:40.720
going for spinal surgery.

00:23:40.720 --> 00:23:41.990
After another heart surgery

00:23:41.990 --> 00:23:43.250
another heart surgery is coming

00:23:43.250 --> 00:23:46.740
up and then spinal surgery, following that

00:23:46.740 --> 00:23:49.870
and may not be able to
make it, help me walk

00:23:49.870 --> 00:23:51.990
but it'll take the pain away.

00:23:51.990 --> 00:23:55.820
And I just stay positive.

00:23:55.820 --> 00:23:57.300
Whether I'm six foot, four standing

00:23:57.300 --> 00:24:00.583
